# {{name}}

A native desktop app built with [Kael](https://github.com/Augani/kael).

The project pins the Rust toolchain used by its matching Kael release.
On macOS, the starter compiles Metal shaders at launch so development works
with either Command Line Tools or full Xcode. For release builds with full
Xcode, remove `runtime_shaders` from the `kael` dependency to precompile them.

## Run

```bash
cargo run
```

## Release build

```bash
cargo build --release
```
